<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Sunglass Hut raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Sunglass Hut raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Montgomery Securities analyst Alice Ruth said Wednesday she had raised her rating on Sunglass Hut International Inc to buy from hold.</p>
<p>-- Further details were not available.</p>
<p>-- Sunglass shares were up 1-1/2 to 7-3/8 in very heavy trade.</p>
<p>((-- Ian Simpson, Wall Street Desk, (212) 859-1879))</p>
</text>
